@startuml
!include skin.iuml
actor Visitor
participant "Cloudflare\nedge (nearest)" as E
participant "Cloudflare\nupper tier (SIN/HKG)" as U
participant Caddy
participant "Astro app" as A
database SQLite as D
== Warm page: most visits ==
Visitor -> E : GET /projects/pocketwise
E --> Visitor : 200 HIT (~tens of ms)
== Cold edge, warm upper tier ==
Visitor -> E : GET /
E -> U : miss, ask upper tier
U --> E : HIT
E --> Visitor : 200 (then cached locally)
== Everything cold, or cache purged ==
Visitor -> E : GET /
E -> U : miss
U -> Caddy : miss, ask origin (Bandung)
Caddy -> A : proxy
A -> D : read profile + projects
D --> A : rows
A --> Caddy : HTML + Cache-Control\ns-maxage=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800
Caddy --> U
U --> E
E --> Visitor : 200 (~1 s, once per region)
note over A,D
/admin and /api are never cached (no-store)
and are not part of the cache rule
end note
@enduml
